# Changelog

This local working copy is being kept English-only for the admin UI and generated output.

## Current Local Changes

- Translated Worker responses, admin API messages, generated labels, and Wrangler comments to English.
- Added English translation for upstream static admin/login pages.
- Added a runtime DOM translator for admin UI text inserted by client-side JavaScript after page load.
- Changed config JSON responses to ASCII-escaped JSON so raw `/admin/config.json` and `/admin/init` responses do not display non-English glyphs while preserving the parsed internal schema.
- Fixed stale Worker host handling so old `.workers.dev` values in stored `HOSTS` are refreshed to the current deployed Worker hostname unless an explicit `HOST` value or custom domain list is configured.
- Preserved custom host lists and explicit `HOST` environment overrides.

## Verification

- Worker syntax check passes.
- Audited HTML, JSON, text, and subscription responses do not expose visible non-English glyphs on the checked surfaces.
- Wrangler deploy dry-run passes.

## Upstream

For the full upstream release history, refer to the original project repository.
